<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP SECOND ROUND REPLAY RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP SECOND ROUND REPLAY RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of an Italian Cup second</p>
<p>round replay match played on Sunday.</p>
<p>Milan beat Empoli 2-0 (halftime 2-0).</p>
<p>Scorer: Marco Simone (7th, 41st)</p>
<p>Atttendance: 23,000</p>
<p>Verona beat Bari 3-0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: De Vitis (penalty 40th), Corini (84th, penalty 90th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
</text>
